27
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:26,060
It seems that the Divine Path

28
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:28,260
is the right way to breakthrough with the Ji Realm.

29
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:38,350
It's an upper Spirit Beast.

30
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:41,170
With my avatar's cultivation,

31
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:43,680
I couldn't see that its soul was still there.

32
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:48,360
Such hostility in his soul...

33
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:50,480
How painful was his death ?

34
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:52,640
Master,

35
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:54,180
