36
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:56,040
Since we met before,

37
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,280
I'll save you.

38
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,560
From now on,

39
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:27,870
