40
00:03:35,730 --> 00:03:36,440
Junior Sister,

41
00:03:36,830 --> 00:03:38,560
where are you going ?

42
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,720
Did something happen ?

43
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:42,040
Junior Sister,

44
00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:43,840
