45
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:46,000
What happened ?

46
00:03:45,990 --> 00:03:46,840
Where are you going ?

47
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:47,640
Sun Zhenwei,

48
00:03:48,550 --> 00:03:49,800
do you really think that

49
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,720
