50
00:03:51,990 --> 00:03:54,040
is enough to stop me ?

51
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,560
If you don't step aside now,

52
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:57,480
then don't blame me for being ruthless.

53
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:00,200
Junior Sister,

54
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,160
