55
00:04:02,300 --> 00:04:03,800
Why would I dare to stop you ?

56
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,920
You can go anywhere you want.

57
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:10,180
I'll be happy to accompany you.

58
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:26,720
Sun Hai
Early stage Core Formation

59
00:04:23,570 --> 00:04:24,960
Little rabbit,

60
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:27,000
I already told you that

61
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:29,160
