65
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:37,250
She's not someone you can handle.

66
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,600
Are you happy now ?

67
00:04:43,550 --> 00:04:45,440
I know you're frustrated

68
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:48,560
but I have no choice except restraining you for now.

69
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,960
The Eastern Courtyard has already sent word.

70
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:52,680
If you keep causing trouble,

71
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:55,080
they will shatter your cultivation.

72
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:16,240
That woman really is despicable.

73
00:05:16,470 --> 00:05:20,560
They even sent an outer sect elder to kill me.

74
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,840
Come.

75
00:05:22,910 --> 00:05:24,560
Kill me, I'm not scared.

76
00:05:24,670 --> 00:05:26,150
If I blink,

77
00:05:26,540 --> 00:05:28,320
then my name is not Cheng Xian !

78
00:05:29,330 --> 00:05:31,120
I was indeed asked by someone to come

79
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,480
but to help you, not kill you.

80
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:34,710
Tell me,

81
00:05:35,910 --> 00:05:37,240
what happened ?

82
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:40,480
Senior,

83
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:41,870
who asked you to help me ?

84
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,640
I will only give you 3 sentences

85
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,840
and that was the first one.

86
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,960
Cheng Ling from the Eastern Courtyard...

87
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:51,720
It's her fault !

88
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:54,160
She caused all this !

89
00:05:55,210 --> 00:05:56,990
The real reason she got close to me

90
00:05:57,030 --> 00:05:58,920
was because she was after my two Spirit Apes.

91
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:02,330
Were they yours ?

92
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:05,020
I know what Senior means.

93
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:07,880
There are many beasts in the Cloud Sky Sect

94
00:06:08,100 --> 00:06:10,520
and they can be used for alchemy.

95
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:13,310
The beasts in the sect

96
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:14,930
are just tools.

97
00:06:15,390 --> 00:06:16,960
But I brought them with me

98
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:19,040
when I joined the sect.

99
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:21,880
According to the Cloud Sky Sect's rules

100
00:06:22,380 --> 00:06:24,120
those two belong to me.

101
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:26,410
So this Cheng Ling got close to you,

102
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:28,000
then asked for the two Spirit Apes.

103
00:06:28,630 --> 00:06:30,280
You wanted to please her

104
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,000
so you handed them over to her.

105
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,320
Correct ?

106
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:34,680
But...

107
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:37,490
But I thought she wanted mounts.

108
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:39,800
I never thought her goal was their Core.

109
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,080
Big Ape

110
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:43,120
already got his Core removed !

111
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:45,320
Only Small Ape is left.

112
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:48,080
I went many times to get him back,

113
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:49,480
but I wasn't allowed inside.

114
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:50,960
It was an outer sect disciple

115
00:06:50,960 --> 00:06:52,120
who hurt me.

116
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:54,360
I'm afraid that

117
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:57,320
my Spirit Ape is in danger.

118
00:06:58,520 --> 00:06:59,600
This is weird.

119
00:07:00,500 --> 00:07:02,080
Cheng Ling's cultivation is very low.

120
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,560
She can't need Beast Cores yet.

121
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:06,720
Someone else is behind all this.

122
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:09,880
Cheng Xian helped me before,

123
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,520
so I will help him

124
00:07:11,500 --> 00:07:12,820
as much as I can.

125
00:07:13,660 --> 00:07:14,760
What should I do ?

126
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,520
Please bring back

127
00:07:19,070 --> 00:07:20,360
Small Ape.

128
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:26,970
Junior Sister,

129
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:28,880
what are you doing ?

130
00:07:40,850 --> 00:07:42,520
I know you are here.

131
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,440
Why aren't you willing to meet me ?

132
00:07:44,570 --> 00:07:45,400
Not even once.

133
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:50,280
Junior Sister,

134
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:51,800
who are you talking to ?

135
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:54,790
Wan'er doesn't ask anything else

136
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,680
but to see you once more.

137
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,840
Over the past 200 years,

138
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:03,120
I've been relying on the spirit liquid to keep my vitality.

139
00:08:03,790 --> 00:08:06,160
But if you aren't willing to come out,

140
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:08,000
then Wan'er will kill herself right now.

141
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:10,760
To release myself

142
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:13,280
from this obsession.

143
00:08:16,530 --> 00:08:18,560
Why are you like this ?

144
00:08:23,990 --> 00:08:26,030
The moment your hand touches your bag of holding

145
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:27,680
is the moment you die.

146
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:32,960
Through the remnants of night, the Dao dreams

147
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,960
as years and seasons swirl unending.

148
00:08:29,150 --> 00:08:30,920
This person is at Core Formation

149
00:08:30,950 --> 00:08:33,520
but he gives off the feeling of a Nascent Soul...

150
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:40,960
Renegade Immortals cultivate thousands of years

151
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:40,960
to reach perfection.

152
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:37,720
Since Brother is Junior Sister Li's friend,

153
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:40,360
you are also the Cloud Sky Sect's friend.

154
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:42,120
If I was rude before,

155
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:43,720
it's a misunderstanding.

156
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:47,840
Pursuing immortality, understanding life and death, Karma and the Dao,

157
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:47,840
is very difficult.

158
00:08:47,870 --> 00:08:51,480
Defying the heavens

159
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:51,480
requires resolve

160
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,640
Do you still have

161
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:51,000
that jade slip ?

162
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,240
I threw it away.

163
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:55,830
day after day, night after night,
through wind and snow, through this human life

164
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:59,710
Like a flying sword

165
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:59,710
soaring through the sky,

166
00:08:56,760 --> 00:08:58,560
Since you threw it away...

167
00:08:58,920 --> 00:09:01,240
Well, it wasn't anything valuable.

168
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:03,530
my aspirations are higher.

169
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:03,320
I'm leaving.

170
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:07,510
I will transcend

171
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:07,510
and break free from the reincarnation cycle.

172
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:11,080
Yet my love never grows old.

173
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,490
The Cloud Sky Sect Ancestors

174
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:12,280
want me to form a cultivation pair with this person.

175
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:14,960
I can turn into an Immortal

176
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:14,960
and defy the heavens

177
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:15,570
Before, I kept rejecting him...

178
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:18,520
but the flowers keep withering.

179
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:18,560
But now, I have no reasons left...

180
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:22,400
My love and resentment

181
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:22,400
are entangled in my heart

182
00:09:20,110 --> 00:09:22,180
If you're still in the country in 3 months,

183
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:25,960
for this unrepentant vow.

184
00:09:23,130 --> 00:09:25,930
then please come to the ceremony.

185
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:30,320
I have forgotten

186
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:30,320
what year it is

187
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:28,800
Congratulations.

188
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:33,820
but I cannot forget your face.

189
00:09:33,870 --> 00:09:37,760
I can turn into an Immortal

190
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:37,760
and defy the heavens

191
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:41,320
but the flowers keep withering.

192
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:41,520
I hate you...

193
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:45,400
My love and resentment

194
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,400
