199
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:56,600
You bitch !

200
00:09:57,680 --> 00:10:00,480
Note: Primordial Yin = virginity

201
00:09:57,680 --> 00:10:00,480
Wait until I snatch your 200 years of Primordial Yin energy.

202
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:02,280
I will humiliate you

203
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:05,580
for rejecting me for so long !

204
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:09,240
As for this guy...

205
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:22,040
The Cloud Sky Sect Ancestors

206
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:25,000
want me to form a cultivation pair with this person.

207
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:27,840
If you're still in the country in 3 months,

208
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:31,080
then please come to the ceremony.

209
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:31,920
Master !

210
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:32,720
Master ?

211
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:37,100
Looks like his heart is in turmoil.

212
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:39,200
I'd better not disturb him now.

213
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:54,040
Sun Lingwu 
Cloud Sky Sect Elder
Middle stage Nascent Soul

214
00:10:46,970 --> 00:10:51,200
You can't come and go as you wish here.

215
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:54,720
Do you look down on our Cloud Sky Sect ?

216
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,200
Here comes a big problem !

217
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,940
He's obviously Nascent Soul.

218
00:10:59,410 --> 00:11:00,880
You overestimate yourself.

219
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:10,140
You're looking for death !

220
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:18,640
Master, this old man is too strong.

221
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:21,670
We should leave while we still can.

222
00:11:23,830 --> 00:11:24,620
Merge !

223
00:11:32,250 --> 00:11:32,780
This is bad.

224
00:11:37,980 --> 00:11:38,880
What's happening !?

225
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:41,200
Quick, protect the pill furnaces !

226
00:11:41,170 --> 00:11:42,630
Master, I'm here. Save me !

227
00:11:43,010 --> 00:11:44,360
Warn the Elders,

228
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,680
quick !

229
00:11:58,730 --> 00:12:00,440
Little rat...

230
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:23,150
He won't come after us, will he ?

231
00:12:23,660 --> 00:12:25,600
I've recovered my low cultivation.

232
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,600
No one will suspect me.

233
00:12:28,110 --> 00:12:29,340
Follow Cheng Ling

234
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:31,600
