235
00:12:31,610 --> 00:12:32,300
Who ?

236
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,020
Me ?

237
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:38,150
Or, you can go and talk with the Nascent Soul guy.

238
00:12:38,510 --> 00:12:39,280
It's up to you.

239
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:44,320
Master,

240
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:45,790
Master,

241
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:48,560
you're too weak for now.

242
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:51,010
I have to protect you.

243
00:12:52,740 --> 00:12:53,800
Okay...

244
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:05,880
Junior Brother,

245
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,280
I have been ordered

246
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:08,680
