247
00:13:24,280 --> 00:13:25,120
This is...

248
00:13:26,390 --> 00:13:27,360
Your Grandmaster,

249
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:28,400
Elder Li Muwan

250
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:30,160
