252
00:13:32,090 --> 00:13:33,640
The invitations have been sent out.

253
00:13:33,790 --> 00:13:35,740
The sect has to be decorated as soon as possible.

254
00:13:42,330 --> 00:13:44,340
Before, I kept rejecting him...

255
00:13:45,540 --> 00:13:47,920
But now, I have no reasons left...

256
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,240
Master, Master !

257
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:52,440
Look !

258
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:54,440
