266
00:14:24,660 --> 00:14:26,720
She has 200 years of Primordial Yin.

267
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:28,300
When I get her,

268
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:30,840
she will be nothing more

269
00:14:31,510 --> 00:14:32,540
than my food

270
00:14:32,980 --> 00:14:34,740
to help me reach Nascent Soul.

271
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:37,530
Are you still competing with her ?

272
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:41,920
Senior,

273
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:43,700
you're so mean !

274
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:47,100
I'll tell you

275
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:48,610
